# Full-site a11y audit — commit only the archived summary/manifest/urls
# files (the audit-trail record). Per-page JSONs are ~52MB and noisy.
# Transient in-progress state at the top level is also ignored.
reports/a11y-full-audit/pages/
reports/a11y-full-audit/archive/*/pages/
reports/a11y-full-audit/_manifest.ndjson
reports/a11y-full-audit/_failures.ndjson
reports/a11y-full-audit/_summary.md
reports/a11y-full-audit/_summary.csv
reports/a11y-full-audit/_urls.txt
reports/a11y-full-audit/_run.log

# IBM Equal Access (accessibility-checker) parallel pipeline — same shape as
# the axe-core audit above. Per-page JSON is large and tool-version-specific.
reports/a11y-full-audit-ibm/pages/
reports/a11y-full-audit-ibm/archive/*/pages/
reports/a11y-full-audit-ibm/_manifest.ndjson
reports/a11y-full-audit-ibm/_failures.ndjson
reports/a11y-full-audit-ibm/_summary.md
reports/a11y-full-audit-ibm/_summary.csv
reports/a11y-full-audit-ibm/_urls.txt
reports/a11y-full-audit-ibm/_run.log

